  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AME Regional Peacebuilding Learning Exchange</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Conflict Transformation and Peacebuilding is a focus in several of the regional/country programmes across AME including the Middle East, Sri Lanka, Myanmar and is an emerging area of work in Afghanistan. With several countries working on peacebuilding with diverse approaches and definitions, there is strong potential for regional engagement.The purpose of the AME Regional Peacebuilding Learning Exchange is to produce co-ordinated learning across CAFOD&#x2019;s peacebuilding programmes in Asia and the Middle East to draw lessons and inform contextually-appropriate best practice.</narrative>
  </description>
